(3277, 4, 'instagram', '17884840268402784', 'Benfits of affiliate marketing:\n1)Low cost of start-up\n\nAn affiliate program does not require that you have an advertising team for ad visuals or purchase ad space.\nRather than that, you’ll have to depend on your affiliates to come up with their marketing content. Other than the initial effort of selecting and vetting affiliates, there’s little effort required from you to market your products, which is one of the reasons it’s become such a popular method of marketing.\n\n2)Flexibility\n\nYou can easily make your affiliate program smaller or bigger at little or no cost. It also offers you a great way to scale up your business without breaking the bank.\n\n3)It’s Versatile\n\nAs an affiliate, you can choose to focus on one type of industry or work with any company that has an affiliate program irrespective of what they are selling. \nThe affiliate marketing model can work with any industry. Therefore, whether they are selling goods or services, affiliates can still sell using the same model.\n\n4)It’s Performance-Based\n\nThe affiliate program is entirely performance-based because affiliates are paid on a commission once they deliver a client. This motivates them to want to do more so that they can deliver the conversion that the advertiser is looking for.\nAffiliate marketing strategy also ensures that only valuable or profitable traffic is driven to the website. This is one of the significant benefits of affiliate marketing that publishers enjoy. \n\n Earn and learn 🤑💷\n\nFollow @shinewithfalguni \n\nDm me to join\n \n#reelkarofeelkaro❤️❤️❤️❤️ #reelsofficial #reeloftheday #affiliatemarketingtips #instagram #affiliatemarketingtips #growyourbrand #personalbrandingonline #personalbrand #beliveinyourself #bosslady #bossgirl #peronalbranding #instagrammarketingtips #instagrammarketing #growypurbusiness #workfromanywhereintheworld #workfromhomejobs #workfromyoursmartphone #bizgurukulcourses #bizgurukulcommunity #bizgurukulindia❤️ #bizgurukulfamily #digitalmarketing #marketingstrategy #marketingideas #conentcreator #socialmedia #socialmediamarketing', '2021-09-23 18:24:04', NULL, 'clients/4/remote_media_64p812kh0o1uajXxifV.mp4', '{\"media_type\":\"VIDEO\",\"thumbnail_url\":\"clients/4/remote_media_64p812kh0o1uajXxifV.mp4\"}', '{\"likes\":52,\"comments\":2}', 2, 0, NULL, 27, NULL, 54, '2021-09-23 18:24:04', 'synced', '2026-08-03 12:13:42', '{\"id\":\"17884840268402784\",\"caption\":\"Benfits of affiliate marketing:\\n1)Low cost of start-up\\n\\nAn affiliate program does not require that you have an advertising team for ad visuals or purchase ad space.\\nRather than that, you\\u2019ll have to depend on your affiliates to come up with their marketing content. Other than the initial effort of selecting and vetting affiliates, there\\u2019s little effort required from you to market your products, which is one of the reasons it\\u2019s become such a popular method of marketing.\\n\\n2)Flexibility\\n\\nYou can easily make your affiliate program smaller or bigger at little or no cost. It also offers you a great way to scale up your business without breaking the bank.\\n\\n3)It\\u2019s Versatile\\n\\nAs an affiliate, you can choose to focus on one type of industry or work with any company that has an affiliate program irrespective of what they are selling.\\u00a0\\nThe affiliate marketing model can work with any industry. Therefore, whether they are selling goods or services, affiliates can still sell using the same model.\\n\\n4)It\\u2019s Performance-Based\\n\\nThe affiliate program is entirely performance-based because affiliates are paid on a commission once they deliver a client. This motivates them to want to do more so that they can deliver the conversion that the advertiser is looking for.\\nAffiliate marketing strategy also ensures that only valuable or profitable traffic is driven to the website. This is one of the significant benefits of affiliate marketing that publishers enjoy.\\u00a0\\n\\n Earn and learn \\ud83e\\udd11\\ud83d\\udcb7\\n\\nFollow @shinewithfalguni \\n\\nDm me to join\\n \\n#reelkarofeelkaro\\u2764\\ufe0f\\u2764\\ufe0f\\u2764\\ufe0f\\u2764\\ufe0f #reelsofficial #reeloftheday #affiliatemarketingtips #instagram #affiliatemarketingtips #growyourbrand #personalbrandingonline #personalbrand #beliveinyourself #bosslady #bossgirl #peronalbranding #instagrammarketingtips #instagrammarketing #growypurbusiness #workfromanywhereintheworld #workfromhomejobs #workfromyoursmartphone #bizgurukulcourses #bizgurukulcommunity #bizgurukulindia\\u2764\\ufe0f #bizgurukulfamily #digitalmarketing #marketingstrategy #marketingideas #conentcreator #socialmedia #socialmediamarketing\",\"media_type\":\"VIDEO\",\"media_url\":\"https://scontent-bom2-4.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQO3MR-_T94RaYd9mFLAEhn-2sLz-gsISQNZswClgCRwvysPuNyzRVgkGFallE99TveFxdNQf0YYe0RP8ClMSNxF-60lPvsH9R4FiKs.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-bom2-4.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=y57gpKTsmKwQ7kNvwH9z9UZ&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MzA1MjEwMDEzNTA2MzM2NywiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjE3NzQsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMDk5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjo1LCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=530e3177ed0539f2&_nc_-B2XmnQEA&_nc_gid=TKANMQFsn9JsH914JDdEeg&edm=AM6HXa8EAAAA&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQHKqGYZKhvs4luGBt4LXHbWpe24D2XsFFwCaoe7Ipoclg&oe=6A726008\",\"timestamp\":\"2021-09-23T18:24:04+0000\",\"like_count\":52,\"comments_count\":2}', '2026-08-03 12:13:42', '2026-08-03 12:13:42'),
